# Deny-all, then allowlist exactly what the build COPYs (Dockerfile).
# Default-deny keeps secret-shaped files (.env, signing-key.hex,
# cairn.toml, …) out of the build context by construction — nothing
# enters unless explicitly allowlisted here.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!.sqlx/
!migrations/
!lexicons/
!src/
